# M5 Task 5 (D8): the self-trained "hey marshmellow" model IS the product asset
# (openwakeword Apache-2.0 code + Apache-2.0 feature extractors; see
# assets/wake/README.md for the recorded license check). Its two feature-extractor
# deps are tracked too (release fix 2026-11-07: the openwakeword 0.6.0 wheel ships
# NO resources/ and nothing in uv sync fetches them, so while they were ignored
# every clean checkout failed to load the wake scorer — the final cleanroom-verify
# FAIL; the old "re-downloadable at build time" note described a fetcher that
# installer/fetch_bundle_inputs.py never had).
!assets/wake/hey-marshmellow.onnx
!assets/wake/melspectrogram.onnx
!assets/wake/embedding_model.onnx
docs/plan/spikes/data/sp4_voice/
docs/plan/spikes/data/sp2_fixtures/
docs/plan/spikes/data/sp3_dev/
docs/plan/spikes/data/sp3_dev_models/
docs/plan/spikes/data/m5_wake_training/

# piper voice models (downloaded; see MARSHMELLOW_VOICE_DIR)
voices/

# ZCode workflow runtime artifacts (skills/ is tracked)
.zcode/workflow-drafts/
.zcode/workflow-runs/
# faster-whisper ct2 model fetched at build time by installer/fetch_bundle_inputs.py
# (M5 Task 7; re-downloadable — the spec bundles it to _internal/models/)
models/

